<title>USA: Bolder Technologies gets purchase orders.</title>
<headline>Bolder Technologies gets purchase orders.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER, Colo. 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bolder Technolgies Corp said it has received purchase orders for more than 500,000 cells for its rechargeable batteries, better than its own expectations.</p>
<p>The orders represent about one-third of its anticipated 1997 production, Bolder Technologies said.</p>
<p>Bolder Technolgies said it had hoped to have 25 percent of its 1997 production capacity committed by the end of the year.</p>
</text>
